flowchart LR
  C[User / RDP client] -->|RDP over TLS| X[xrdp]
  B[Generic desktop broker] -->|OIDC| K[Keycloak]
  K -->|validated identity context| B
  B -->|distinct BAF assertion| C
  X -->|SCP opaque assertion| S[xrdp-sesman]
  S -->|EICP opaque assertion| E[xrdp-sesexec]
  E --> V[JWT/JWS provider]
  V --> J[Configured JWKS / PEM trust]
  V --> R[(Replay cache)]
  E --> N[NSS]
  E --> P[PAM account/session]
  P --> N
  E --> L[Existing XRDP session startup]
